{"annotations":{"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Single entry point to all PearlGraph Uganda tourism data. Pick an `action`: map (audience, month) - unified map, entry rules and source catalogue; attractions (query, region, category) - parks, sites, hours, activities, durations; fees (feeIds) - UWA tariffs, including the low season permit rates for April, May and November; route (from, to, month) - road km and drive time; plan (start, stops | days, month) - build or check an itinerary by drive time, opening hours and activity length; lodges (near, tier, district, type, query) - stays, `near` = attraction id within 90 min drive; districts (query, region); essentials (audience: foreign|local); seasons (region) - seasons and operators; permits (attractionId) - permit capacity per sector and access rules; transport (query) - airstrips, flights, ferries; search (query, kind: attraction|district|stay) - meaning-based search over free text, e.g. 'see apes in rainforest'; graph (query = id or name, depth 1-2, predicate) - knowledge-graph links: inDistrict, inRegion, isA, offers, pricedBy, anchoredAt, roadTo. Ids come from earlier results (e.g. kampala, bwindi-rushaga).","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"enum":["map","attractions","fees","route","plan","lodges","districts","essentials","seasons","permits","transport","search","graph"],"type":"string"},"attractionId":{"maxLength":60,"type":"string"},"audience":{"enum":["foreign","local"],"type":"string"},"category":{"maxLength":40,"type":"string"},"days":{"items":{"items":{"properties":{"activityId":{"maxLength":60,"type":"string"},"attractionId":{"maxLength":60,"type":"string"}},"required":["attractionId","activityId"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":6,"type":"array"},"maxItems":30,"type":"array"},"depth":{"maximum":2,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"district":{"maxLength":40,"type":"string"},"